## Rules
- Do not edit rules or custom_rules.py. If the distribution looks wrong (e.g. a rule never fires or fires on everything), report it and suggest the `define-known-discrepancy` or `tune-from-review` skill.

## Output
Command, `run_id`, number classified, and the classification / KD distribution.
